    <span>A comprehensive policy also includes “delay liability,” compensating you for any extra storage or accommodation costs incurred due to transport interruptions</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
</div>

<p>Choosing a mover who bundles these documents with a solid insurance plan gives you peace of mind. Whether you’re hiring <em>domestic movers in Vadodara</em> or looking for <em>packers and movers Dev Nagar Vadodara</em>, verify that they can produce a valid e‑Way bill, an IBA‑approved LR, and a full‑value IRDAI policy.</p>

